DUAL STREAM (D24 specimen: two data relations of one type over two backends, an objective that MAXIMIZES the
fixture rank - the dispatch order is the reverse of Byte Relay's; strategy cardinality 2 x 2 = 4)
@{system dual_stream "Dual Stream"}
@{type Chunk}
@{metric preference_rank ordinal "fixture policy rank; not a measurement"}
@{objective spread}
@{goal spread 1 maximize preference_rank}
@{component source}
@{component splitter}
@{component sink}
@{port source.out out: Chunk public}
@{port splitter.in in: Chunk public}
@{port splitter.out out: Chunk public}
@{port sink.in in: Chunk public}
@{data feed source.out -> splitter.in mode=copy}
@{data drain splitter.out -> sink.in mode=copy}
@{invariant i_reach reachable(source, sink)}
